# Derived artefacts -- regenerate with `make pipeline`, do not commit.
# 42 MB of model binaries (including the same XGBoost model as both .pkl and
# .joblib) and every derived CSV used to be tracked. Committed artefacts then
# drifted from the code that produced them: the RAG metadata claimed a
# sentence-transformers backend the repo cannot install, and carried Windows
# paths from a different machine than the committed CSVs.
models/*.pkl
models/*.joblib
models/*.npy
data/interim/
data/processed/

.runtime/
